        "description": {
          "content": "If the highlights are valid and the premium listing is `ACTIVE` and not currently awaiting an existing update it will return the premium listing with a `WAITING_FOR_UPDATE` status. If the highlights are invalid, the premium listing is not currently `ACTIVE` or the listing is already `WAITING_FOR_UPDATE` it will return the appropriate error.\n",
          "type": "text/plain"
        },
